            "keyAbilityText": "Constitution",
            "terms": [
                [
                    "Attunement",
                    "The 1st-level choice between bio-attuned and chrome-attuned — see §03. A one-time fork, not a stance you swap later."
                ],
                [
                    "Clean Take",
                    "1st-level feature, both attunements. A critical failure on an Install check (cybernetic) or a Graft check (bio-organic) performed on your body is instead treated as a normal failure — you never roll on the Install Mishap table or the Rejection table. Applies no matter who makes the check: a shop surgeon, an ally, or yourself."
                ]
            ],
